msgstr "Chunguza mradi"

msgid "What can I investigate?"
msgstr "Naweza kuchunguza nini?"

msgid "Results appear as you type. Ranked matches use project name, county, contractor, and institution — built to stay fast across thousands of records."
msgstr "Matokeo yanaonekana unapoandika. Mechi zilizopangwa hutumia jina la mradi, kaunti, mkandarasi, na taasisi — ili ibaki haraka kwenye maelfu ya rekodi."

