msgstr "Miradi, nyaraka, kaunti, majina ya faili…"

msgid "Try a project name, county, or institution. Two characters is enough to start."
msgstr "Jaribu jina la mradi, kaunti, au taasisi. Herufi mbili zinatosha kuanza."

msgid "What H.Y.D.R.A. means"
msgstr "H.Y.D.R.A. inamaanisha nini"

msgid "Each letter is a principle: people, results, evidence, the right to know, and a path to oversight."
msgstr "Kila herufi ni kanuni: watu, matokeo, ushahidi, haki ya kujua, na njia ya usimamizi."

