msgstr "Kazi"

msgid "Follow. Find. Act."
msgstr "Fuata. Pata. Chukua hatua."

msgid "Three moves on the public record — only as far as the files go."
msgstr "Hatua tatu kwenye rekodi ya umma — kadri faili zinavyoruhusu."

msgid "Find the evidence"
msgstr "Pata ushahidi"

msgid "Trace allocation, approval, procurement, contract, implementation, and completion — without filling gaps that sources do not support."
msgstr "Fuatilia mgao, idhini, ununuzi, mkataba, utekelezaji, na ukamilishaji — bila kujaza pengo ambalo vyanzo haviungi mkono."

msgid "Every claim should point to a source document, a page, and a verification status. If evidence is missing, H.Y.D.R.A. says so."
msgstr "Kila dai linapaswa kuelekeza kwenye waraka, ukurasa, na hali ya uthibitisho. Ushahidi ukikosekana, H.Y.D.R.A. inasema hivyo."

msgid "Take action"
msgstr "Chukua hatua"

msgid "Submit a citizen observation, compare it with official information, and generate a structured accountability report."
msgstr "Wasilisha maoni ya mwananchi, yalinganishe na taarifa rasmi, na utengeneze ripoti ya uwajibikaji."

