msgstr "Hatua 1 ni jina la mtumiaji na nchi. Nchi chaguomsingi ni Kenya. Hatua 2 ni nenosiri na masharti."

msgid "Tracking uses that country’s administrative units — counties in Kenya, regions in Tanzania, states in Nigeria."
msgstr "Ufuatiliaji hutumia vitengo vya nchi hiyo — kaunti Kenya, mikoa Tanzania, majimbo Nigeria."

