msgstr "H.Y.D.R.A. inachukuliaje hii"

msgid "Your words are labelled as a citizen observation."
msgstr "Maneno yako yameandikwa kama maoni ya mwananchi."

msgid "Official claims stay in their own field."
msgstr "Madai rasmi yanabaki kwenye uga wao."

msgid "Nothing here is a finding of corruption or fraud."
msgstr "Hakuna hapa kilicho uamuzi wa ufisadi au ulaghai."

msgid "Guest observations are anonymous. Signed-in users can hide their account name."
msgstr "Maoni ya mgeni hayana jina. Walioingia wanaweza kuficha jina la akaunti."

