msgstr "Usionyeshe jina la akaunti yangu kwenye maoni haya"

msgid "The observation stays attached to your account so you can find it later. Public and shared copies can be labelled anonymous."
msgstr "Maoni yanabaki yamefungamana na akaunti yako ili uyapate baadaye. Nakala za umma zinaweza kuandikwa zisizo na jina."

